      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.96,
      "end_seconds": 4.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.08,
      "end_seconds": 10.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.8,
      "end_seconds": 24.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "I've been feeling tired and I wanted to get it checked. I've never really been one for hospitals. My family kept telling me to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.02,
      "end_seconds": 28.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.26,
      "end_seconds": 37.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Probably about two weeks. Yeah. I thought it would sort itself out but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.8,
      "end_seconds": 42.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.39,
      "end_seconds": 53.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "I'd say mild. Oh I've also had slight warmth for two weeks. I've had night sweats too for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.51,
      "end_seconds": 57.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "right, right. Time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.76,
      "end_seconds": 72.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.15,
      "end_seconds": 92.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "okay: pressure 112 over 80, temp 36.6 degrees and SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 85."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.0,
      "end_seconds": 97.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.06,
      "end_seconds": 103.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "they help me see the the whole picture, more shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.08,
      "end_seconds": 109.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.98,
      "end_seconds": 112.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Right, nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.74,
      "end_seconds": 131.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "The knee is mildly warm with a small effusion and the replacement scar is clean."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.75,
      "end_seconds": 136.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.77,
      "end_seconds": 149.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "any high fever severe pain recent injury or wound discharge at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.83,
      "end_seconds": 153.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "No none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.83,
      "end_seconds": 158.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "is your urine normal no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.18,
      "end_seconds": 163.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Ah that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.55,
      "end_seconds": 168.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.69,
      "end_seconds": 170.6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.16,
      "end_seconds": 174.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.49,
      "end_seconds": 183.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for two years now. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.22,
      "end_seconds": 195.44,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.72,
      "end_seconds": 199.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.91,
      "end_seconds": 219.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the moment? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.12,
      "end_seconds": 225.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I'm on gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.64,
      "end_seconds": 230.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.01,
      "end_seconds": 234.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "about two months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.0,
      "end_seconds": 238.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.83,
      "end_seconds": 246.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Just a a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.31,
      "end_seconds": 249.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.79,
      "end_seconds": 255.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.37,
      "end_seconds": 259.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.56,
      "end_seconds": 264.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.65,
      "end_seconds": 273.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.15,
      "end_seconds": 277.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.25,
      "end_seconds": 289.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.08,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, this looks most like a possible low-grade infection of the knee replacement. Wear and tear is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.23,
      "end_seconds": 292.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.45,
      "end_seconds": 304.18,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible low-grade infection of the knee replacement do well once it's treated properly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.0,
      "end_seconds": 329.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "let's book a joint aspiration to to look into warm effusion that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.73,
      "end_seconds": 334.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "so, good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    }
  ]
